# Frontend

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) Auth and Localization sections.

- RTK Query `injectEndpoints` from feature files; kebab-case file names
- shadcn/ui primitives; no hardcoded UI strings (i18n keys)
- Server state in RTK Query; client-only state in slices
- i18n: custom `shared/i18n/db-backend.ts` only — no `i18next-http-backend`
- Auth refresh: ADR-003 body refresh — bootstrap + axios 401 mutex (details in AGENTS.md)
